<title>USA: Allen Organ sets special, regular payouts.</title>
<headline>Allen Organ sets special, regular payouts.</headline>
<dateline>MACUNGIE, Pa. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allen Organ Co said Friday it has set a special cash dividend of $0.03 per share in addition to a regular quarterly dividend of $0.13 per share on its Class A and Class B common stock.</p>
<p>The dividends are to be paid November 29 to holders of record at the close of business November 15.</p>
</text>
